<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="https://w3id.org/optimar#"
     xml:base="https://w3id.org/optimar"
     xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
     xmlns:terms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://w3id.org/optimar#">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/optimar/2.3"/>
        <dc:creator>Alberto Montero (USAL)</dc:creator>
        <dc:creator>Alejandro Flores (USAL)</dc:creator>
        <dc:creator>Cristina Aceta (Tekniker)</dc:creator>
        <dc:creator>Oihana Garcia (Tekniker)</dc:creator>
        <dc:description xml:lang="es">Esta ontología describe los componentes, fallos, sensores y eventos relacionados con las plataformas eólicas offshore.</dc:description>
        <dc:description xml:lang="en">This ontology describes the components, failures, sensors, and events related to offshore wind platforms.</dc:description>
        <dc:language>en</dc:language>
        <dc:name xml:lang="en">OPTiMAR Offshore Wind Ontology</dc:name>
        <dc:name xml:lang="es">Ontología Offshore OPTiMAR</dc:name>
        <dc:rights>https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT</dc:rights>
        <dc:title xml:lang="en">Offshore Wind Power Platform Ontology for OPTiMAR</dc:title>
        <dc:title xml:lang="es">Ontología de Plataforma Eólica Offshore para OPTiMAR</dc:title>
        <terms:abstract xml:lang="en">Ontology modeling structural elements, sensors, events, and failures in floating offshore wind platforms, including measurement data, involved actors, and semantic relationships between components. Compatible with SOSA for observations and QUDT for units of measure.</terms:abstract>
        <terms:abstract xml:lang="es">Ontología que modela los elementos estructurales, sensores, eventos y fallos de plataformas eólicas offshore, incluyendo datos de medición, actores involucrados y relaciones semánticas entre componentes. Compatible con SOSA para observaciones y QUDT para unidades de medida.</terms:abstract>
        <terms:bibliographicCitation xml:lang="en">Flores, A., Montero, A., Garcia, O., &amp; Aceta, C. (2025). Offshore Wind Power Platform Ontology for OPTiMAR. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.17962874</terms:bibliographicCitation>
        <terms:bibliographicCitation xml:lang="es">Flores, A., Montero, A., Garcia, O., &amp; Aceta, C. (2025). Ontología de Plataforma Eólica Offshore para OPTiMAR. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.17962874</terms:bibliographicCitation>
        <terms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-09-30</terms:created>
        <terms:identifier rdf:resource="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17962874"/>
        <terms:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-12-02</terms:issued>
        <terms:license rdf:resource="https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"/>
        <terms:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-07-13</terms:modified>
        <terms:publisher xml:lang="es">Universidad de Salamanca, Centro Tecnológico y de Investigación - Tekniker</terms:publisher>
        <terms:publisher xml:lang="en">University of Salamanca, Technology and Research Centre - Tekniker</terms:publisher>
        <terms:rights xml:lang="es">Este trabajo se distribuye bajo la licencia MIT. Se permite copiar, modificar y distribuir bajo los términos de dicha licencia.</terms:rights>
        <terms:rights xml:lang="en">This work is distributed under the MIT License. It may be copied, modified, and distributed under the terms of this license.</terms:rights>
        <terms:status xml:lang="es">estable</terms:status>
        <terms:status xml:lang="en">stable</terms:status>
        <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>optimar</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
        <vann:preferredNamespaceUri rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/optimar#"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">
    Version 2.3 (2026-07-13) - Parques eólicos, nuevos sensores/datos y reorganización de la monitorización:
    - Añadida la clase WindFarm y la jerarquía de composición WindFarm -&gt; WindPowerPlatform -&gt; Turbine/Component
    - Añadidas clases: Inverter (Component), ApparentPowerSensor (ElectricalSensor), RotationalSpeedSensor (Sensor),
      WindData/WindDirectionData/WindSpeedData (Measurement)
    - &quot;monitors&quot; y &quot;monitoredBy&quot; pasan a ser propiedades genéricas de nivel superior; todas las propiedades
      &quot;...Monitors&quot;/&quot;...MonitoredBy&quot; existentes pasan a ser subpropiedades de las mismas
    - Se crea &quot;actorMonitors&quot; (subpropiedad de &quot;monitors&quot;) para la relación Actor -&gt; Component/Sensor
    - &quot;isMonitoredBy&quot; se renombra a &quot;turbineComponentMonitoredBy&quot; (subpropiedad de &quot;monitoredBy&quot;)
    - Se crea &quot;measures&quot; como superpropiedad genérica; todas las propiedades &quot;measures...&quot; pasan a ser subpropiedades
    - Se crean &quot;measuresWindSpeed&quot; y &quot;measuresWindDirection&quot; (subpropiedades de &quot;measures&quot;, dominio Anemometer) para
      enlazar el anemómetro con WindSpeedData/WindDirectionData, siguiendo el mismo patrón que measuresYawAngle/measuresPitchAngle
    - Se crean las propiedades &quot;isInstalledIn&quot;/&quot;hasInstalled&quot; (sensor-componente) y &quot;hasTurbine&quot;, &quot;hasPlatform&quot;,
      &quot;hasComponent&quot; (composición de parque/plataforma)
    - Añadida la data property &quot;measurementType&quot;
    - Correcciones de consistencia: &quot;duration&quot;, &quot;pressureLevel&quot;, &quot;stressLevel&quot; y &quot;vibrationLevel&quot; quedan declaradas
      únicamente como owl:ObjectProperty (su rango qudt:QuantityValue es una clase, no un tipo de dato); se elimina
      la doble tipificación de &quot;hasGeneratedData&quot;; RotationalSpeedSensor se añade al axioma de disjunción de sensores
    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
    Version 2.3 (2026-07-13) - Wind farms, new sensors/data, and monitoring property reorganization:
    - Added the WindFarm class and the composition hierarchy WindFarm -&gt; WindPowerPlatform -&gt; Turbine/Component
    - Added classes: Inverter (Component), ApparentPowerSensor (ElectricalSensor), RotationalSpeedSensor (Sensor),
      WindData/WindDirectionData/WindSpeedData (Measurement)
    - &quot;monitors&quot; and &quot;monitoredBy&quot; become generic top-level properties; all existing &quot;...Monitors&quot;/&quot;...MonitoredBy&quot;
      properties become subproperties of them
    - Added &quot;actorMonitors&quot; (subproperty of &quot;monitors&quot;) for the Actor -&gt; Component/Sensor relationship
    - &quot;isMonitoredBy&quot; renamed to &quot;turbineComponentMonitoredBy&quot; (subproperty of &quot;monitoredBy&quot;)
    - Added &quot;measures&quot; as a generic superproperty; all &quot;measures...&quot; properties become subproperties of it
    - Added &quot;measuresWindSpeed&quot; and &quot;measuresWindDirection&quot; (subproperties of &quot;measures&quot;, domain Anemometer) linking
      the anemometer to WindSpeedData/WindDirectionData, following the same pattern as measuresYawAngle/measuresPitchAngle
    - Added &quot;isInstalledIn&quot;/&quot;hasInstalled&quot; (sensor-component) and &quot;hasTurbine&quot;, &quot;hasPlatform&quot;, &quot;hasComponent&quot;
      (wind farm/platform composition) properties
    - Added the &quot;measurementType&quot; data property
    - Consistency fixes: &quot;duration&quot;, &quot;pressureLevel&quot;, &quot;stressLevel&quot; and &quot;vibrationLevel&quot; are now declared solely as
      owl:ObjectProperty (their qudt:QuantityValue range is a class, not a datatype); removed the double typing of
      &quot;hasGeneratedData&quot;; RotationalSpeedSensor added to the sensor disjointness axiom
    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/optimar#changelog"/>
        <owl:backwardCompatibleWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/optimar/2.2"/>
        <owl:priorVersion rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/optimar/2.2"/>
        <owl:versionInfo xml:lang="en">Version 2.3 of the Ontology</owl:versionInfo>
        <owl:versionInfo xml:lang="es">Versión 2.3 de la ontología</owl:versionInfo>
        <foaf:homepage rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/optimar"/>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


